cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this fixed release and acknowledge the upstream sources."
type: software
title: "Graph reinforcement learning for dynamic flexible job shop scheduling under composite disturbances with a schedule-stability budget: reproducibility package"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bestwangyu/reproducibility_package"
url: "https://github.com/bestwangyu/reproducibility_package/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an event-driven graph reinforcement-learning workflow
  for dynamic flexible job shop scheduling under composite disturbances with a
  schedule-stability budget. Includes source code, inherited synthetic instances,
  frozen checkpoints, experiment protocols, and archived result summaries.
  Author-owned software and checkpoints are Apache-2.0; original experimental
  results and protocol documentation are CC BY 4.0. Third-party rights are retained.
